Package: CustomRNVF
Type: Package
Title: OHDSI Study: Cohort Generation, Diagnostics, Characterization and Incidence Rate
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-06-22
Authors@R: person("Andrei", "Kiselev", email = "kiselev.eco@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Andrei Kiselev <kiselev.eco@gmail.com>
Description: A self-contained OHDSI study package that runs cohort generation,
    CohortDiagnostics, Characterization, and incidence rate calculation against an
    OMOP CDM. The package contains only orchestration logic; all analytics and SQL
    are produced by the underlying OHDSI packages. Run the study by calling
    execute() (see extras/CodeToRun.R).
