    CohortGenerator (>= 0.12.2),
    CohortDiagnostics (>= 3.4.2),
    Characterization (>= 2.2.0),
    CohortIncidence (>= 4.1.0),
    FeatureExtraction (>= 3.11.0),
    DatabaseConnector (>= 7.0.0),
    SqlRender (>= 1.19.4),
    ParallelLogger (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
